# 🧩 Major Components

| Component                   | Description                                               |
| --------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |
| Enhanced Process Management | Provides improved process visibility and management       |
| `ps`                        | Displays process information from the kernel              |
| MLFQ Scheduler              | Implements priority-based multi-level feedback scheduling |
| System Call Tracing         | Tracks system calls made by processes                     |
| Performance Monitoring      | Collects kernel execution and scheduling metrics          |
| Benchmark Suite             | Measures system behavior under different workloads        |
| Dedicated Tests             | Validates newly implemented functionality                 |
| xv6 `usertests`             | Ensures existing xv6 functionality remains intact         |

