# 📁 Project Structure

The project follows the standard xv6-riscv organization while incorporating additional kernel and user-space components.

Important directories and files include:

```text
xv6-riscv/
│
├── kernel/              # xv6 kernel source
│   ├── proc.c           # Process management / scheduler
│   ├── proc.h           # Process structures
│   ├── syscall.c        # System-call handling
│   ├── syscall.h        # System-call definitions
│   ├── sysproc.c        # Process-related system calls
│   └── ...
│
├── user/                # User-space programs
│   ├── ps.c             # Process monitoring utility
│   ├── ...
│
├── Makefile             # Build configuration
│
├── README.md            # Project documentation
│
└── ...
```

> The exact files and organization may vary depending on the implementation of each enhancement.

