# 🔬 Testing Strategy

The project follows a layered testing approach:

```text
                ┌─────────────────────┐
                │   Feature Testing   │
                └──────────┬──────────┘
                           │
                           ▼
                ┌─────────────────────┐
                │ Dedicated OS Tests  │
                └──────────┬──────────┘
                           │
                           ▼
                ┌─────────────────────┐
                │ Benchmark Testing   │
                └──────────┬──────────┘
                           │
                           ▼
                ┌─────────────────────┐
                │ xv6 usertests       │
                │ Regression Testing  │
                └──────────┬──────────┘
                           │
                           ▼
                    ┌─────────────┐
                    │   Verified   │
                    └─────────────┘
```

This ensures that new functionality is tested independently while the existing xv6 behavior is continuously validated.

